{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_14\">Problem 14</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 14\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/3/5139f9d2c3b9daa6454c86f7be5502fd10f97ab2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> is a solution of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f81b18eea6d142e31a6f26f51153cd8c38abb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - ax+b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" /> and the representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> in the base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> number system is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, \nthen the base-n representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adcbf72080d547fefd7cdd197ba3fe4b82317871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 80 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 81 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 280$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assuming the solutions to the equation are n and m, by Vieta's formulas, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/a/51a880f9964c7c09a8f11b683798299081ad9727.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_n + m_n = 18_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" />.  \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e986814caf711e3281b9fd1ea5fa7a393b902bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_n = 10_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68ef8a346bdffcd8839331270b014483f4610e27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10_n + m_n = 18_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"15\" />.  \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/c/b8c57a634afb792fabbb95c92c13e4aa2d0e88b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m_n = 8_n\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Also by Vieta's formulas, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40a99a23ac27aa0718c01d6b7a47f2a3931436c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_n \\cdot m_n = b_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/beb4ec53090d0593057bc99fe0519abd398fb0a9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10_n \\cdot 8_n = \\boxed{80_n}\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>The answer is (C) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5<